  m_text: "A steady drumbeat fills the air. Up ahead, a lone figure in a goat costume
    moves across the snow, ribbons swaying with each step. It\u2019s Capra\u2014familiar
    yet strange, performing the ritual all alone, no singers, no dancers, just the
    rhythm of the drum echoing clearly in the cold.\n\n\n\n\r\n\n\n\n\nLoading...\r\n"
